 info on how to avoid it next time or similar, all in All in all, an interesting experience, especially in multiplayer, but solo is not bad either, although I think it's best to play in 2-3", "timestamp_created": 1774998669, "timestamp_updated": 1774998669, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1740578356", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222214353", "author": {"steamid": "76561199836089840", "personaname": "Mazen", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199836089840/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4179, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2908, "last_played": 1786313900, "avatar": "e77402447aaa5f213489376f56d0c7672e533b4f"}, "language": "english", "review": "SOOO ADDICTING", "timestamp_created": 1774998627, "timestamp_updated": 1774998627, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1740578356", "reactions": []}]}